                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Record of Decisions, Council of Foreign Ministers,
                        Third Session, Deputies, 129th Meeting, Waldorf-Astoria Hotel, New York,
                        December 6, 1946, 11 a.m.</hi><anchor n="5" xml:id="d388-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>
